            <tr><td class="num">2</td><td>When positions were opened</td><td>Spread over the bars of the window in proportion to each bar's traded volume <em>as a share of its own trailing {POSITION_LIFE_DAYS}-day window</em>, which is what stops a rising market from loading every cohort onto its latest bars</td><td class="num">assumed</td></tr>
            <tr class="is-active"><td class="num">3</td><td>Leverage mix</td><td>{coincide
